<title>CHINA: Deutsche Bank sets red-chip conglomerates warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets red-chip conglomerates warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Thursday it launched 680 million American-style call warrants on a basket of red chip conglomerate.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd	  0.1 shrs</p>
<p>China Merchants Holdings Co nt'l Co Ltd 0.1 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.744     PREMIUM	 19.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.122     GEARING	 3.4x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  12.MAY.98    LISTING DATE  13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 11.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$4.165     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
